{"addedOn":10,"avgRating":["fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o"],"breadcrumbsHtml":"<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117\">OpenEdge Development: ABL Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ABL-Syntax-Reference.html\">ABL Syntax Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<span class=\"active\">DEFINE WORKFILE statement</span>\n","class":"manual","created":1470,"dislikeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/dislike/309296","html":"<article class=\"hascomments\" data-page=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/DEFINE-WORKFILE-statement.html\" id=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/DEFINE-WORKFILE-statement.html\"><main role=\"main\"><article aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\" class=\"dita\" id=\"DEFINE-WORKFILE-statement\" role=\"article\">\n  <h1 class=\"title topictitle1 reference\" id=\"ariaid-title1\">DEFINE WORKFILE statement</h1>\n  \n  <div class=\"body refbody\">\n    <section class=\"section\">\n      <p class=\"p\">See the <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"DEFINE-WORK-TABLE-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/DEFINE-WORK-TABLE-statement.html\">DEFINE WORK-TABLE statement</a> reference entry.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">This statement is supported\nonly for backward compatibility. Use the <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"DEFINE-TEMP-TABLE-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/DEFINE-TEMP-TABLE-statement.html\">DEFINE TEMP-TABLE statement</a>, instead.</p>\n      <div class=\"note note note_note\"><span class=\"note__title\">Note:</span> Does not apply\nto SpeedScript programming.</div>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"DEFINE-WORKFILE-statement__syntax_GC16GJ2688959\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d453714e110\">Syntax</h2>\n      \n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"DEFINE-WORKFILE-statement__idGDJ29R2668129\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>DEFINE <strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">{</strong><strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">[</strong><strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">[</strong> NEW <strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">]</strong> SHARED <strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">]</strong><strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">|</strong><strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">[</strong> PRIVATE <strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">]</strong><strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">}</strong>\n  <strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">{</strong> WORK-TABLE <strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">|</strong> WORKFILE <strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">}</strong><var class=\"keyword varname\">work-table-name</var>\n  <strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">[</strong> NO-UNDO <strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">]</strong>\n  <strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">[</strong> LIKE <var class=\"keyword varname\">tablename</var><strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">]</strong>\n  <strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">[</strong> FIELD <var class=\"keyword varname\">field-name</var>\n      <strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">{</strong>     AS <var class=\"keyword varname\">data-type</var>\n         <strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">|</strong>  LIKE <var class=\"keyword varname\">field</var>\n      <strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">}</strong>\n      <strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">[</strong><var class=\"keyword varname\">field-options</var><strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">]</strong>\n  <strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">]</strong><strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">...</strong></code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n<nav role=\"navigation\"><div class=\"familylinks\"><div class=\"previouslink\"><strong>Previous topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"DEFINE-WORK-TABLE-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/DEFINE-WORK-TABLE-statement.html\">DEFINE WORK-TABLE statement</a></div><div class=\"nextlink\"><strong>Next topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"DEFINED-preprocessor-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/DEFINED-preprocessor-function.html\">DEFINED preprocessor function</a></div></div></nav><nav class=\"related-links\" role=\"navigation\"></nav></article></main></article>\n","isWatched":false,"labelText":"Product; Product > OpenEdge; Product > OpenEdge > Version 11.7; Format; Format > Documentation","likes":0,"likeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/like/309296","myDocsURL":null,"numOfPageViews":0,"numOfRatingsText":"<span>0 Ratings","revised":1470,"showWatch":false,"topicMeta":[["bookowner","oe11docs"],["bookrights","oe11docs"],["bundle","openedge-abl-reference-117"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge/product_openedge_117"],["data","OEInformationHub/format"],["data","OEInformationHub/format/format_documentation"],["organization","oe11docs"]],"topicTitle":"DEFINE WORKFILE statement","topicurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/DEFINE-WORKFILE-statement.html","type":"Manual"}